      "diagnostics": [
        "unresolved-performance-actor"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_10007_01_j:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_10007_01_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「2人はずっと音楽に関する仕事をしていますが、\n好きなことを仕事にする辛さはありませんか？」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "司会"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "unknown",
        "reason": "unresolved-performance-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "unresolved-performance-actor"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_10007_01_j:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_10007_01_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もちろん、楽しいことばかりではない。\n音楽が要因となって、辛い経験をしたこともある。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "008rei"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "008rei",
        "presence": "unknown",
        "reason": "medium-policy-unavailable",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 15
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_10007_01_j:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_10007_01_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だが、それでも……。\n音楽に触れている時間が、一番幸せだと感じるんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "008rei"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "008rei",
        "presence": "unknown",
        "reason": "medium-policy-unavailable",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 16
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_10007_01_j:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_10007_01_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それに、辛いことがあったとしても、\n支えてくれる人たちがいれば乗り越えられる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "008rei"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "008rei",
        "presence": "unknown",
        "reason": "medium-policy-unavailable",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 17
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_10007_01_j:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_10007_01_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだね。……辛くなった時のために、\n好きなことが同じ人を見つけてみるのはどうかな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "007kei"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "007kei",
        "presence": "unknown",
        "reason": "medium-policy-unavailable",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 18
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
